<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 20px 55px;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: justify;
      }
      .main-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .memo-and-date {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }

      .memo {
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .company-name {
        line-height: 150%;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .permit-details {
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .details-container {
        margin: 12px 8px 12px 28px;
      }

      .details {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        line-height: 150%;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .left {
        width: 35%;
      }

      .right {
        width: 55%;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .terms-and-condition {
        margin: 18px 0;
        line-height: 150%;
      }

      .title {
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .terms-list {
        margin-left: 14px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="main-title">building permit</div>

      <div class="memo-and-date">
        <p class="memo">
          Memo No: <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.trackingId)%>
        </p>
        <p class="date">
          Date: <%=
          formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.certificateGenerateDate)%>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="company-name">
        <p>
          To: <%=
          formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName)%>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="permit-details">
        <p>
          Upon consideration of your application and drawings and documents
          submitted therewith, BEZA grants the Building Permit for construction
          of building as described below:
        </p>
        <div class="details-container">
          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>Name of the Economic Zone</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.economicZone)%>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>Plot Number</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.plotAddress)%>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>Land Area(sqm)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.agreedLandByDevelopersSqm)%>
                sqm
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>No. of Building</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.numberOfBuildingInfo)%>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>Building Area(sqm)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.totalBuildingArea)%>
                sqm
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="details">
            <div class="left">
              <p>Total Floor Area(sqm)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
              <p>
                : <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.hiddenTotalFloorArea)%>
                sqm
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-and-condition">
        <p class="title">Terms and Conditions for Approval:</p>

        <ol class="terms-list">
          <li>
            <p>
              The construction shall be implemented as per the approved Plan and
              Drawings. No alteration or modification in the plan, design or
              construction work shall be made without obtaining prior approval
              from the BEZA.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              This Building Permit (the Permit) shall remain valid for 1 (one)
              year from the date of its issuance and shall become invalid if the
              construction works is not commenced within this period or
              construction work is abandoned or suspended after commencement.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              The construction works shall be implemented in strictly compliance
              with the Bangladesh National Building Code, 2020, Bangladesh
              Economic Zone (Construction of Building Rules), 2017, Fire
              Fighting Floor Plan approved by the FSCD, terms and conditions of
              ECC for orange A and B Category and EIA approval of DoE for Red
              Category Project.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              You shall submit the application form with other required
              documents for the Inspections to BEZA-OSS Center.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              This Permit is issued based on the, information and documents
              furnished by you with your Building Permit Application.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              You shall submit the application requesting Inspections by
              BEZA-OSS Center the phase-wise progress of construction work as
              below:
            </p>
            <div class="details-container">
              <div class="details">
                <div class="left">
                  <p>(i) First Inspection</p>
                </div>
                <div class="right">
                  <p>: at the stage of foundation work;</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="details">
                <div class="left">
                  <p>(ii) Second Inspection</p>
                </div>
                <div class="right">
                  <p>: at the stage of structure framing work; and</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="details">
                <div class="left">
                  <p>(iii) Final Inspection</p>
                </div>
                <div class="right">
                  <p>: at the end of completion of construction work.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              After completion of construction and before using the building,
              you shall obtain completion certificate from BEZA.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              In the event of any violation of any terms and conditions set for
              above, or any order or direction issued by BEZA during
              construction or after inspection, this Permit may be suspended or
              cancelled.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              BEZA reserves the rights to issue any addendum to this permit and
              such addendum, if issued, shall form the part of this Permit.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          text-align: center;
          background: #dfbdcd;
          padding: 24px 0 24px 0;
          font-weight: 600;
          color: rgb(171, 34, 34);
          margin-top: 12px;
          opacity: 0.8;
        "
      >
        <p>
          THIS IS A COMPUTER GENERATED PERMIT. SO SIGNATURE IS NOT REQUIRED.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
